<% content_for :title, "Mixed Symptoms Relapse Plan | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="relapse-plan-page">

  <section class="relapse-plan-hero">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <%= link_to "← ALL RELAPSE PLANS", toolbox_relapse_plans_path,
          class: "relapse-plan-back" %>

      <p class="relapse-plan-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / RELAPSE PLANS / MIXED SYMPTOMS
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>WIRED.</span>
        <span>MISERABLE.</span>
        <span>NOW WHAT?</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="relapse-plan-intro">
        MY SOBRIETY PLAN WHEN THINGS FEEL MIXED.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-yellow">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">01 / MY EXPERIENCE</p>
      <h2>HOW THIS<br>SHOWS UP.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Describe your experience of mixed symptoms and the connection to drinking.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-black">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">02 / RECOGNIZING MY PATTERNS</p>
      <h2>WHAT AM I<br>NOTICING?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MOOD &amp; THOUGHTS</h3>
          <p>[Write your personal warning signs.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>ENERGY &amp; SLEEP</h3>
          <p>[Write the changes that matter in your own pattern.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>URGES &amp; ACTIONS</h3>
          <p>[Write how your behavior and drinking urges change.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHAT I WANT ALCOHOL TO DO</h3>
          <p>[Write the relief or change you find yourself looking for.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-purple">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">03 / MY IMMEDIATE PLAN</p>
      <h2>WHAT HAPPENS<br>NEXT?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY FIRST ACTIONS</h3>
          <p>[Write the immediate steps from your personal plan.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY SURROUNDINGS</h3>
          <p>[Write your agreed plan for your environment and access to alcohol.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-pink">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">04 / SUPPORT &amp; SAFETY</p>
      <h2>HAVE THE<br>CONTACTS READY.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY PEOPLE &amp; CARE TEAM</h3>
          <p>[Add contacts, what to tell them, and your backup.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY AGREED SAFETY STEPS</h3>
          <p>[Add clinician-reviewed warning signs, care instructions, and urgent steps.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>